==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*orzuměti}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Cs-rozumět.ogg|audio|lang=cs}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# {{lb|cs|transitive|with dative}} to [[understand]]
#: {{ux|cs|Vůbec tomu '''nerozumím'''.|I do not understand it at all.|inline=1}}
# {{cs-reflexive|d}} to [[go without saying]]
#: {{ux|cs|To '''se rozumí''' samo o sobě.|That is understandable on its own.|inline=1}}
# {{cs-reflexive|i}} to [[understand]] (another person sympathetically); to [[sympathize]] with
#: {{ux|cs|Alena a Petr '''si''' spolu dobře '''rozumí'''.|Alena and Petr understand each other well.|inline=1}}

